flowchart LR
  Dev[Developers] --> PR[Git Pull Request]
  PR --> CI[CI Pipeline]
  CI --> UT[Unit and Lint Tests]
  UT --> PKG[Build Artifacts]
  PKG --> CT[Container Image]
  CT --> STG[Deploy to Staging]
  STG --> UAT[User Acceptance Testing]
  UAT -->|Approval| CD[Promote to Production]
  CD --> PROD[Deploy to Production]
  PROD --> MON[Monitoring and Alerts]
  PROD --> BKP[Automated Backups]

  subgraph Security Gates
    SAST[Static Analysis]
    DAST[Dynamic Tests]
    DEPCHK[Dependency Scans]
  end

  CI --> SAST
  CT --> DEPCHK
  STG --> DAST
